      <h2>Quick takeaway</h2>
      <p>
        Faro is one of the most practical airports in Portugal for picking up a rental car, but the process
        depends heavily on whether your provider is based inside the terminal or outside the main airport setup.
        That distinction matters much more than many first-time renters expect.
      </p>
